@startuml
' Logical View - Level 1

!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam rectangle {
    roundCorner 25
}

actor Developer

rectangle "Trade-off Aware Refactoring System" as System {
    component "CLI Orchestrator" as CLI
    component "Prioritization Engine" as Engine
    component "Parfum Integration" as ParfumAdapter
}

Developer --> CLI : 1. Executes command (e.g., prioritize)
CLI -> Engine : 2. Invokes prioritization logic
Engine -> ParfumAdapter : 3. Requests smell analysis
ParfumAdapter -> CLI : 4. Returns enriched smell data
CLI --> Developer : 5. Displays prioritized plan

@enduml
